{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-appraisal","title":"历史评价与定位","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scholarly-assessment","title":"学术界的多元评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/scholarly-assessment","wordCount":1725,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"his-place-in-history","title":"他在历史中的地位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/his-place-in-history","wordCount":1629,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"历史评价与定位\">历史评价与定位</h1><p>在审视了争议之后，本章尝试为达尔文给出公允的历史评价：学术界如何看待他的成就与局限，以及他在科学史与人类思想史上应有的地位。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档梳理学术界对达尔文的多元评价，包括对其原创性、时代局限与历史形象的反思。第二篇文档尝试为他的历史地位作总体定位，把他的成就放回时代背景中加以衡量。</p>\n"}